/*
  KioskSettingsModal.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 modal / dialog · 0025 · KioskSettingsModal (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native `KioskSettingsModal`
  resolves (table "KioskSettingsModal") lives here with its English value. The web source
  (features/dashboard/components/KioskSettingsModal.tsx) hardcodes its copy through `t(key, fallback)`
  and inline option-array labels; the native surface routes every string — including the picker
  option labels — through a key so no English literal lives in Swift. These entries fold into the app
  `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog at integration time; they are kept in a per-surface table so
  each parallel surface prompt owns its own strings without editing the shared catalog.

  Groups: dialog chrome + states; the freshness chip / banners; the footer; the form section titles +
  control labels; the picker option labels (rotation / cursor / dim / clock); the transparency copy +
  preview + hint; and the accessibility summaries.
*/

